# Smart Contact Manager (SCM)

A cloud-deployed contact management web application built using **Java, Spring Boot, Spring Security, Thymeleaf, and MySQL-compatible TiDB**.

The application allows users to register, securely log in, manage their contacts, maintain their profiles, and schedule reminders for contacting people.

**Live Application:** https://smartcontactmanager-o8o4.onrender.com  
**GitHub Repository:** https://github.com/DEVVRATSHARMA-ZZZ/smartContactManager

---

## 1. Project Overview

Smart Contact Manager is a web-based application designed to help users store, organize, and manage their personal or professional contacts in one place.

Instead of maintaining contacts manually, users can access their contact information through an authenticated web application.

The application also provides scheduled call reminders, email notifications, profile management, and social login functionality.

### Main Features

- User registration and login.
- Email verification during registration.
- Google OAuth 2.0 login.
- Password encryption using BCrypt.
- Secure user-specific contact management.
- Add, view, update, and delete contacts.
- Profile management and profile picture support.
- Cloud-based image storage using Cloudinary.
- Contact reminders with scheduled notifications.
- Reminder popups and email notifications.
- Optional SMS notification integration.
- Light and dark theme support.
- Responsive user interface.

