GitHub OAuth configuration is also present in the production configuration:

```text
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET
```

Only configure integrations that are actually enabled and being used.

**Never share actual credentials in README files, screenshots, public repositories, or interviews.**

